						760490802
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760490802,
					"content": "How curious... I have heard melodies like this before, but your playing lends a whole new dimension...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Damselette"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490803,
					"content": "#Ah, maybe because {NICKNAME} was channeling {M#his}{F#her} emotional connection to that place...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760490804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760490804,
					"content": "What's curious is that... I feel as if I can picture the landscape just by listening to the melody. I wonder how the real thing compares to my imagination...",
